{"id":16100,"date":"2025-03-13T15:06:37","date_gmt":"2025-03-13T15:06:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/?p=16100"},"modified":"2025-04-04T13:26:34","modified_gmt":"2025-04-04T13:26:34","slug":"devlop-participa-na-1-a-edicao-do-cargo-freight","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/devlop-participa-na-1-a-edicao-do-cargo-freight\/","title":{"rendered":"Devlop Participa na 1.\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Cargo Freight"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"16100\" class=\"elementor elementor-16100\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-3bc9a670 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"3bc9a670\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-514b204a\" data-id=\"514b204a\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-17159d4c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"17159d4c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.18.0 - 08-12-2023 *\/\n.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-stacked .elementor-drop-cap{background-color:#69727d;color:#fff}.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-framed .elementor-drop-cap{color:#69727d;border:3px solid;background-color:transparent}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap{margin-top:8px}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap-letter{width:1em;height:1em}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap{float:left;text-align:center;line-height:1;font-size:50px}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap-letter{display:inline-block}<\/style>\t\t\t\t<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"><div dir=\"auto\"><p data-start=\"65\" data-end=\"521\"><span data-start=\"67\" data-end=\"77\">Nos dias 12 e 13 a <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/\"><strong data-start=\"67\" data-end=\"77\">Devlop<\/strong><\/a> marcou presen\u00e7a na <strong data-start=\"97\" data-end=\"128\">1.\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do <a href=\"https:\/\/www.supplychainmagazine.pt\/cargofreight\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Cargo Freight<\/a><\/strong>, um evento de grande relev\u00e2ncia para o setor dos transportes e log\u00edstica, organizado pela <a href=\"https:\/\/www.supplychainmagazine.pt\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong data-start=\"219\" data-end=\"244\">Supply Chain Magazine<\/strong><\/a> e realizado na cidade de <strong data-start=\"270\" data-end=\"280\">Aveiro<\/strong>. Este encontro reuniu diversos especialistas, empresas e profissionais da \u00e1rea, proporcionando um espa\u00e7o para a discuss\u00e3o das principais tend\u00eancias, desafios e oportunidades que moldam o futuro da log\u00edstica e dos transportes.<\/p><p data-start=\"523\" data-end=\"1115\">Durante o evento, tivemos a honra de participar na <strong data-start=\"574\" data-end=\"671\">mesa-redonda &#8220;Transporte 4.0: como a digitaliza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a redefinir o futuro dos transportes&#8221;<\/strong>. Neste painel de debate, discutimos o impacto crescente da <strong data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"748\">digitaliza\u00e7\u00e3o<\/strong> no setor, abordando como as novas tecnologias est\u00e3o a transformar a forma como operamos, otimizamos processos e criamos solu\u00e7\u00f5es mais sustent\u00e1veis e eficientes. Explor\u00e1mos ainda as <strong data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"968\">principais tend\u00eancias tecnol\u00f3gicas<\/strong>, como a intelig\u00eancia artificial, a automatiza\u00e7\u00e3o e o big data que est\u00e3o a impulsionar a moderniza\u00e7\u00e3o da ind\u00fastria.<\/p><p data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1507\">Foi uma oportunidade\u00a0 para a troca de ideias e experi\u00eancias com <strong data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1249\">especialistas, l\u00edderes de empresas e profissionais do setor<\/strong>, permitindo-nos aprofundar a reflex\u00e3o sobre os desafios e as oportunidades que o futuro nos reserva. Este momento de partilha refor\u00e7ou a import\u00e2ncia da <strong data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1431\">colabora\u00e7\u00e3o e da inova\u00e7\u00e3o<\/strong> como pilares fundamentais para a evolu\u00e7\u00e3o da log\u00edstica e dos transportes.<\/p><p data-start=\"1509\" data-end=\"1890\">A nossa participa\u00e7\u00e3o neste evento reafirma o compromisso da <strong data-start=\"1569\" data-end=\"1579\">Devlop<\/strong> em continuar a impulsionar a <strong data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1647\">inova\u00e7\u00e3o e a transforma\u00e7\u00e3o digital<\/strong> no setor. Acreditamos que, atrav\u00e9s das nossas solu\u00e7\u00f5es inovadoras, podemos contribuir para a constru\u00e7\u00e3o de um futuro mais <strong data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1824\">eficiente, sustent\u00e1vel e tecnologicamente avan\u00e7ado<\/strong>, respondendo \u00e0s exig\u00eancias de um mercado em constante evolu\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/p><p>Para mais informa\u00e7\u00f5es contacte a Devlop<\/p><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b1ed009 e-grid e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"b1ed009\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;gri